# The thinking map of the antigravity-sdk AgentHarness (docs/adr/0040 §2):
# maps each role's THINKING (low|medium|high, PLAN §5) to the Gemini API
# thinking level configured via LocalAgentConfig / GeminiModelOptions.
#
# Gemini: ThinkingConfig.thinking_level accepts low|medium|high on
# gemini-3.8-flash (Google AI Studio docs, "Thinking",
# https://aistudio.google.com/docs/thinking, read 2026-11-03; verified with
# google-antigravity SDK references/agent_configuration.md, read 2026-11-25).
GEMINI_LOW=low
GEMINI_MEDIUM=medium
GEMINI_HIGH=high
